flowchart TD
  accTitle: Doc save pipeline
  accDescr: Editing a doc debounces, serialises, writes atomically and reports a conflict if the file changed on disk.
  A([Keystroke]) --> B[Debounce 300 ms]
  subgraph Save
    direction TB
    B --> C[Serialise blocks]
    C --> D{Disk changed?}
    D -- no --> E[(Write atomically)]
    D -- yes --> F[/Show conflict banner/]
  end
  E --> G((Saved))
  F --> H[Reload from disk]
  H --> A
